        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>NGP R100x79, 1\" x 79\" x 12\" Ramp</b>\r\n<p>\r\n79\" wide x 1\" high x 12\" length aluminum ADA compliant ramp.   Made from non rusting T5 aluminum alloy and used for ADA compliance on floors with 1-1/4\" high lip.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMill finish Aluminum.  Packaged with #10 flat head zinc plated wood screws. Fluted top with typical wall thickness of .110\". \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n</p>\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nAlso available <a href=\"/products/15-inch-ramp-side-plates-pair-ngp-rce-15\"><b>Side Cover Plates</b></a>\r\n</p> -->\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for NGP R100x79 Aluminum Ramp\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 79\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Thickness: .110 (7/64\")</li>\r\n<li>Material: T5 aluminum alloy</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Mill Finish Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Installation Screws: #10 FH Zinc Plated Wood Screws</li>\r\n<li><b>ADA Compliant</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
